# Firmum Model Gate

Use the **lowest gate that can do the current task well**. User preference: **Claude 4.6** family (Sonnet default, Opus for risk). **No Codex, no Opus 5/4.8** unless user overrides.

**Never use Grok** unless the user names Grok in that message.

See also: `model-selection-firmum.mdc` for cost-tier workflow.

## Gates

| Gate | Use this model | Typical work |
|------|----------------|--------------|
| **G0** | Composer 2.5 Fast | Routes, copy, shells, lint, mocks, build, deploy commands |
| **G1** | Claude 4.6 Sonnet (thinking) | Plaid, Stripe, billing, CRUD APIs, React features, multi-file backend |
| **G2** | Claude 4.6 Opus (thinking) | Security review, IDOR/compliance, AI guardrails, complex migration review |
| **G4** | Human | Stripe Dashboard, prod env, live DB migrations, legal |

