## At a gate boundary

Stop. End with:

```
## MODEL SWITCH REQUIRED → [Model]

[What just finished]. Next is [task]. Switch the Agent picker to **[Model]**, then paste:

[one-paragraph resume prompt]
```

## Subagents

Default: **Composer 2.5 Fast**. Use **Claude 4.6 Sonnet** only when the delegated task min gate is G1+.
